    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<br><br>I am quite new with Shiny, but I stumbled onto a conflict between withMathJax and slider creations in the same renderUI.<br>Using the p function instead of withMathJax can overcome the issue, but it will not compile the LaTeX code.<br><br>I put below a minimal code for a reproducible example:<br><br>In the server.R:<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shinydashboard</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  reg</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">reactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    column</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">width </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">12</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>           sliderInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inputId </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;exclu&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                       label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Exlure les ... premières valeurs de la régression&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                       min </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">max </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">step </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>           </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>           withMathJax</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Be: $$ln(N_{(t)})=ln(k)+ln(2)\\\\times \\\\frac{t}{G}$$&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">### replacing this by p(&quot;...&quot;) corrects the issue</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  output$regression</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">reg</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>The ui.R file:<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shinydashboard</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>dashboardPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  dashboardHeader</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Generation time&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  dashboardSidebar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sidebarMenu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    menuItem</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Graphic&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tabName </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;dashboard&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> icon </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> icon</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;dashboard&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  dashboardBody</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tabItem</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tabName </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">