    [
     3,
     "<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Mon, Nov 30, 2015 at 9:21 AM Joe Cheng &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">j...@rstudio.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">There seems to be a bug. You can work around it for now by putting withMathJax around uiOutput(&quot;regression&quot;) as well.</div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Mon, Nov 30, 2015 at 7:06 AM Paul Deveau &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">deveau.p...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<br><br>I am quite new with Shiny, but I stumbled onto a conflict between withMathJax and slider creations in the same renderUI.<br>Using the p function instead of withMathJax can overcome the issue, but it will not compile the LaTeX code.<br><br>I put below a minimal code for a reproducible example:<br><br>In the server.R:<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shinydashboard</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  reg</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">reactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    column</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">width </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">12</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>           sliderInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">inputId </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;exclu&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                       label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Exlure les ... premières valeurs de la régression&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                       min </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">max </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">step </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>           </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>           withMathJax</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Be: $$ln(N_{(t)})=ln(k)+ln(2)\\\\times \\\\frac{t}{G}$$&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">### replacing this by p(&quot;...&quot;) corrects the issue</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  output$regression</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">reg</span><span style=\"color:#660\">())</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>The ui.R file:<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shinydashboard</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>dashboardPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  dashboardHeader</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Generation time&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  dashboardSidebar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sidebarMenu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    menuItem</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Graphic&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tabName </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;dashboard&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> icon </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> icon</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;dashboard&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  dashboardBody</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tabItem</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tabName </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;dashboard&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                              fluidRow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">column</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">width </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">offset </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                              h1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Parameters&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                              uiOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;regression&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">                   <br>                                              align </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;center&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                              <br>                              </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                              </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>Do you have any idea of what could trigger the issue? Is it some kind of conflict between the two functions to render the html page?<br><br>Thanks a lot,<br>Paul<br></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/f81f471a-c091-4850-a1c0-fbb05ea234a8%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/f81f471a-c091-4850-a1c0-fbb05ea234a8%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395861680000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ADqv_V4zxZOUs2O_UC-Gz\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/shiny-discuss/f81f471a-c091-4850-a1c0-fbb05ea234a8%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395861680000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2O2RGBM2iroNZgHR4EX4OG\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div></blockquote></div>\r\n"
